The lettersUS and figuresUS constants in alphabet.go are adapted from
testdata/protocol/alphabet-us.csv, a transcription of the US tables in fldigi
4.2.06, src/rtty/rtty.cxx. Named controls are represented by ASCII bytes;
FIGS/LTRS use non-text placeholders. The encoder logic is original project code.

